# {{lb|en|fishing}} A fishing [[seine]] having a purse cable which acts as a draw string for the bottom of the [[net]] allowing entire schools of fish to be enclosed and brought up. See [http://www.cetaceanbycatch.org/gear_purse_seine.cfm "Purse Seine"].

